     typst template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 14 pt (CivLR 5.1: no smaller than 14-point; size 28 half points);
     Body Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst pitch, CivLR 5.1 double spacing on numbered lines) with a half-inch
